------------------------------------------------------------

-- The migration tooling has its own implementation contract: parsing the
-- WordPress XML, stripping shortcodes, downloading attachments, mapping
-- legacy categories to sections, and emitting Markdown front matter.
deferred WordPressMigration          -- see: scripts/migrate.md (when written)

