open question "Marcia's photo and bio — is there a professional portrait
              and short biography to render at /marcia/, or is that page
              text-only? If a portrait exists, it should also be the
              default og:image for the /marcia/ page (Physician schema)."

open question "Does the curation step include re-illustrating any pages?
              Some legacy images are low-resolution screenshots; replacing
              them is out of scope unless explicitly requested."

open question "Static search — there are 33 pages and 47 glossary terms.
              A client-side index (e.g. lunr.js built at deploy time)
              would aid navigation but adds JavaScript and a build step.
              Defer until the site is live and behaviour is observed."

open question "Citations — should medical pages include references to
              source studies in a structured way (linked endnotes,
              schema.org citation property)? This strengthens YMYL
              ranking and patient trust but requires editorial work."

open question "Search Console verification — should we register the site
              with Google Search Console and Bing Webmaster Tools at
              launch? If yes, the verification meta tag goes in
              SiteIdentity.search_console_verification."

open question "OG default image — does Marcia have a preferred photo or
              illustration for the default 1200x630 social card, or do we
              produce a typographic card from the site title?"
